AcOH <79-101 b•AcOH> The trieicosapeptide derivative <79-101 a> (1.4g,
0.41mmol) was hydrogenated over Pd/C in 80% acetic acid (100ml). The
reaction mixture was worked up in usual manner, and the residue was
precipitated from DMF with water. Yield 1.3 g, 95%. [α]20 D = - 58.51 °C
and [α]20 546 = - 67.28 °C (c 0.8, acetic acid); tlc: 10, 11. Anal.
calcd, for C169H277N23O38 •CH3COOH (3299.19): C 62.24, H 8.59, N 9.77;
found: C 62.66, H 8.49, N 9.44.
