$DATUM (-)-1-[((1-L-Leucinyl-(S)-piperidin-3-yl)amino)acetyl]-L-proline amide x
2 TFA (S)-LpipGP) ((S)-18). A suspension of (S)-17 (250 mg, 0.41 mmol)
and Pd/C (10%) (cat.) in ethanol (3 mL) was stirred under a H2 atmosphere
at room temperature for 24 h. The catalyst was removed by filtration
through a pad of Celite and the solvents were removed in vacuo. The
residue was dissolved in dichloromethane/TFA (1:1) (1 mL) and the
reaction mixture was stirred at room temperature for 4 h. The solvent and
excess of reagent were removed in vacuo to give the TFA salt of
(S)-LpipGP ((S)-18). Light yellow solid, yield 180 mg, 73%. Analytical
reversed phase HPLC (the mobile phase was 2.0-28.4% CH3CN in H2O for 30
min with 0.085% TFA throughout) tR 15.2 min, 100% purity; [α]D 20 -15.9
(c 0.62, CH3OH); 1H NMR (CD3OD) δ 4.48-4.40 (m, 2H, ProH1, LeuH1),
4.21-4.03 (m, 2H, PipH1a, PipH5a), 3.97 (s, 2H, GlyH1), 3.69-3.48 (m, 3H,
PipH1b, PipH5b, PipH2), 3.36-3.31 (m, 2H, ProH4), 2.32-2.17 (m, 2H,
PipH3a, ProH2a), 2.11-1.49 (m, 9H, ProH2b, LeuH3, PipH4, PipH3b, LeuH2,
ProH3), 1.09-0.95 (m, 6H, LeuH4, LeuH5); 13C NMR (CD3OD) δ 176.7 (ProCO),
170.3 (LeuCO), 165.4 (GlyCO), 61.6 (ProC1), 55.0 (PipC2), 50.5 (LeuC1),
47.7 (GlyC1), 47.0 (ProC4), 46.6 (PipC1), 44.3 (PipC5), 41.2 (LeuC2),
31.0 (ProC2), 27.1 (PipC3), 25.5 (LeuC3), 25.4 (ProC3), 23.5 (LeuC4 or
LeuC5), 23.2 (PipC4), 21.7 (LeuC5 or LeuC4); IR (KBr) v 3422, 2966, 2363,
1676, 1457, 1202, 1130 cm-1; HRMS (FT-ICR-MS) Calcd for C18H33N5O3 [M+H]+
368.2656, found 368.2655; pKa1 = 4.35, pKa2 = 10.06.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM 43% overall yield from ester derivative
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM 3-Aminopiperidine-based peptide analogues as the first selective
noncovalent inhibitors of the bacterial cysteine protease IdeS
